parts.content:
AI-Powered Blog Platform with WordPress + GitHub Pages + SEO + Monetization

Project Vibe

Build a lightweight, AI-enhanced blog platform that pairs with WordPress for backend management, deploys via GitHub Pages, and implements immediate monetization strategies for Philippine creators.

Core Architecture

Frontend (GitHub Pages) + WordPress (Headless CMS) + AI Integration + Monetization Layer
Tech Stack Prompt

// Core Stack
const stack = {
  frontend: "Next.js/React (Static Generation)",
  hosting: "GitHub Pages + GitHub Actions",
  backend: "WordPress.com (Free Tier)",
  styling: "Tailwind CSS + ShadCN UI",
  ai: "OpenAI API + Vercel AI SDK",
  seo: "next-seo + JSON-LD structured data",
  monetization: "WordPress.com Payments + Affiliate APIs",
  deployment: "Automatic via GitHub Actions"
};
Key Features to Implement

AI Integration Components
// AI-powered writing assistant
- Content idea generator (Philippine tech/AI trends)
- Auto-tagging and categorization
- SEO title/description generator
- Local language (Filipino/English) translator
- Content summarizer for social sharing
Monetization Implementation
// Monetization modules
const monetization = {
  donations: {
    provider: "Stripe (Philippines support)",
    component: "One-time payment buttons",
    placement: "Article footers, sidebar widget"
  },
  paidNewsletters: {
    provider: "WordPress.com built-in",
    integration: "REST API for subscriber content"
  },
  affiliateLinks: {
    platforms: ["Amazon PH", "Lazada", "Shopee"],
    components: ["Smart link converter", "Disclosure banners"]
  },
  sponsorships: {
    features: ["Sponsored post labeling", "Custom disclosure templates"]
  }
};
SEO & Performance
toast-ui-seo:
  components:
    - Auto-generated sitemap.xml
    - Robots.txt optimization
    - Open Graph meta tags
    - Twitter card integration
    - JSON-LD for articles
    - Core Web Vitals optimization
    - Lazy loading for images

